# Round 18, C1-47 (fixed). L §5.16 The closed list: "mean(d) of a distribution value is refused (LOAD-RANDOM, A-42)",
# in an ask line too (snap11 printed the table's mean, 5).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
input a2: num
input b4: num
input m5: num

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  a2 = 2
  b4 = 4
  m5 = 5

ask q1: mean(normal(m5, b4))
=== expect
refused: LOAD-RANDOM ...
